{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/掀山轰","pageid":7420,"revid":17881,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%8E%80%E5%B1%B1%E8%BD%B0&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%8E%80%E5%B1%B1%E8%BD%B0&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%8E%80%E5%B1%B1%E8%BD%B0&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>掀山轰</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.8E.80.E5.B1.B1.E8.BD.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"掀山轰\"><b>掀山轰</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 掀山轰.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/88/psq7jui70bxgpmkz9she55jwkfl4khi.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%8E%80%E5%B1%B1%E8%BD%B0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/88/psq7jui70bxgpmkz9she55jwkfl4khi.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%8E%80%E5%B1%B1%E8%BD%B0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/88/psq7jui70bxgpmkz9she55jwkfl4khi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />掀山轰\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>近战、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1(2-5)\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）将目标投掷到其范围2~5格内任意[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">空地</span>]，对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰属性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰属性</font></span></span>][<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">范围伤害</span>]。<br />✦若投掷对象为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物品\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">物品</font></span></span>]，则返还能量消耗、冷却，并可[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再行动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再行动</font></span></span>]，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。<br />✦随后将该目标击退<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格。若发生碰撞，则对碰撞双方中的敌人额外造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>伤害。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1(2-5) 2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fb/7mmp568yq3oainsk9na3gdlbfulcdxx.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1%282-5%29_2.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fb/7mmp568yq3oainsk9na3gdlbfulcdxx.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1%282-5%29_2.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fb/7mmp568yq3oainsk9na3gdlbfulcdxx.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1%282-5%29_2.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"200\" data-file-height=\"200\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%98%BF%E5%88%97%E5%85%8B%E8%B0%A2%E2%80%A2%E9%A3%8E%E9%9B%AA%E5%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/阿列克谢•风雪孤行\"><img alt=\"头像 阿列克谢•风雪孤行.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e7/p3uev98o9wqyvt0sj9v59pw1twf9swg.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">阿列克谢•风雪孤行</font></div>\n</div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:80px;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"孤锋\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%AD%A4%E9%94%8B\" title=\"技能图鉴库/孤锋\"><img alt=\"技能背景 传说.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/70px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/105px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"127\" data-file-height=\"127\" /></a></div>\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"孤锋\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%AD%A4%E9%94%8B\" title=\"技能图鉴库/孤锋\"><img alt=\"技能 孤锋.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/0gdbj84myd51ukelo771qi7mhr2s14k.png/70px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%AD%A4%E9%94%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/0gdbj84myd51ukelo771qi7mhr2s14k.png/105px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%AD%A4%E9%94%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/de/0gdbj84myd51ukelo771qi7mhr2s14k.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"skill_icon_name\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89